    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cat City, where Throy\u2019s story takes place, a dreamless yellow cat whose self-discovery journey you\u2019ll follow throughout the game as he tries to find a dream to pursue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat City: A Story About Dreams is a modern Point N\u2019 Click game with Visual Novel elements. It\u2019s a calm, relaxing and cheerful experience, perfect for those who wish to step away from reality but are not into the popular and extremely frenetic games from nowadays. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the usual Point N\u2019 Click mechanics, you\u2019ll also find: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames throughout your journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat City will soon come out to PC and mobile devices.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cat City, where Throy\u2019s story takes place, a dreamless yellow cat whose self-discovery journey you\u2019ll follow throughout the game as he tries to find a dream to pursue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat City: A Story About Dreams is a modern Point N\u2019 Click game with Visual Novel elements. It\u2019s a calm, relaxing and cheerful experience, perfect for those who wish to step away from reality but are not into the popular and extremely frenetic games from nowadays. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the usual Point N\u2019 Click mechanics, you\u2019ll also find: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames throughout your journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat City will soon come out to PC and mobile devices.</p>",
    "short_description": "Cat City: A Story About Dreams is a modern Point N\u2019 Click with Visual Novel elements. The game tells the story of Throy, a dreamless yellow cat who you\u2019ll follow on a self-discovery journey as he tries to find a dream for himself!",
